Package: ifrs9etl
Type: Project
Title: IFRS9 ETL Tool — R port of the Excel/VBA tool
Version: 0.1.0
Description:
    Reads bank portfolio data from the IFRSIN folder, applies IFRS9 staging
    rules and a 3-variable satellite macro model, and writes 18 standardised
    CSV files to the IFRSOUT folder for downstream LIC tool ingestion.
    Direct port of `Updated_ETL_File__Test__V7_-_2025-NS.xlsm`.
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    readxl,
    rvest,
    xml2,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    readr,
    yaml,
    lubridate,
    glue,
    purrr
Suggests:
    testthat,
    waldo
RoxygenNote: 7.3.0
